      "value": "<p><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=vYUjQlCYEETd0ZPk]], any creature that starts its turn in a 10-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}. <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Poisoned apply=false] condition until the start of its next turn. While Poisoned, the target can take either an action or a Bonus Action on its turn, not both, and it can't take Reactions.</p>",
